# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in to turn accounts and sync on.
# With these unset the app runs as it always has: guest only, no sign-in.
#
# Both values are in the Supabase dashboard under Project Settings → API.
# The anon ("publishable") key is safe to ship in the browser: the database's
# access rules are what protect the data. NEVER put the service-role
# ("secret") key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
